Package: f2c-coverage-planner-scripts
Version: 1.0.0+20260313143426
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6, python3-numpy, python3-matplotlib, python3-shapely, python3-scipy
Maintainer: BDR <bdr@example.com>
Description: Fields2Cover coverage planner (Python scripts)
 Installs the latest Python GUI and helper scripts for the Fields2Cover coverage planner.
 This package contains scripts only; runtime Python deps like open3d/fields2cover may need
 to be installed separately depending on your system.
